# OpenRouter API key for the Free Cloud AI pool (20 free models)  
# Get yours at https://openrouter.ai/keys  
# Keep this file as-is — put your real key in .env (never commit .env)  
# OpenRouter powers Free Cloud AI and is also used as Aura's final fallback.
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-api-key

# Optional provider-specific Aura backends. If omitted, Aura falls back to OpenRouter.
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your-cerebras-api-key
# GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key
